    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the galaxy! You are Nick Duster, better known as &quot;IcoNick&quot;, a war veteran of the intergalactic congregation, who has been brought back to defend the planets from hostile alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different galaxies are under attack and you will be hired for different missions, repel asteroid belts and possible invasions of alien fleets to avoid a possible war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your turret, with high firepower, to destroy everything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The congregation will send you supplies with support ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy gigantic bosses and all ships that are hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship shooting game, with 3 game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts - Missions in different galaxies with final bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteroids - Total elimination to avoid damage to facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion - Hostile fleets attack and must be avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick games full of action and strategy. Get to level up, rank up and prestige to get your highest badge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Nick fight the congregation's enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peace in the galaxy depends on you, even if you have to go on missions to all of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of galaxies await your help.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the galaxy! You are Nick Duster, better known as &quot;IcoNick&quot;, a war veteran of the intergalactic congregation, who has been brought back to defend the planets from hostile alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different galaxies are under attack and you will be hired for different missions, repel asteroid belts and possible invasions of alien fleets to avoid a possible war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your turret, with high firepower, to destroy everything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The congregation will send you supplies with support ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy gigantic bosses and all ships that are hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship shooting game, with 3 game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts - Missions in different galaxies with final bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteroids - Total elimination to avoid damage to facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion - Hostile fleets attack and must be avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick games full of action and strategy. Get to level up, rank up and prestige to get your highest badge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Nick fight the congregation's enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peace in the galaxy depends on you, even if you have to go on missions to all of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of galaxies await your help.</p>",
